      "instance_name": "prank_or_revenge",
      "label": "prank or revenge",
      "description": "The meme implies a planned retaliation or prank ('bomb going off in 2 mins') in response to the teacher's criticism. This concept relies on real-world understanding of student behavior, social dynamics, and the idea of 'getting back' at authority figures — a common trope in youth culture and humor.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_03b1e002"
