      "instance_name": "school_bomb_threat",
      "label": "school bomb threat",
      "description": "The concept of a 'bomb going off in 2 mins' is a reference to real-world school safety protocols and the serious nature of bomb threats in educational institutions. While the meme is fictional, the reference to a bomb threat in a school context adds to the absurdity and humor by juxtaposing a real-world danger with a child's prank.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
